      "shelf_visible": true,
      "emoji": "\ud83e\uddf8",
      "body_text": "And then one day it started branching out and spawning its own node types, like in that other thing where someone was trying to point out how infinity is infinately variable and according to multiverse theory all possible versions of the universe also exist, but if truly all variations exist than that means that out there is another universe exactly identical to ours because that is also an option, so the node realized it can spawn its own node type and just you know... started swarming and charming all over the place."
